Mutant for the custody test (web/src/features/agentops/provider-accounts-custody.test.tsx).

The shell's authority-boundary custody no longer removes a retired boundary's mutations
from the MutationCache; it still removes that boundary's queries. A pending adoption's
variables then outlive the boundary that submitted them, so the custody test must fail in
retiredAdoptionGone. Applied by the provider accounts qualification workflow; never
committed to product source.

